@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    ActorBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
    ParticipantBorderColor #555555
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontName "Arial"
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ActorFontName "Arial"
}

actor "Bidder (Client)" as Client
participant "AuctionController" as Controller
participant "AuctionServiceImpl" as Service
participant "AuctionRedisService" as Redis
participant "AuctionBroadcastService" as Broadcast
database "MySQL DB" as DB

Client -> Controller: POST /api/v1/bids {sessionId, amount}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: placeBid(sessionId, userId, amount)
activate Service

Service -> Redis: executeBidScript(sessionId, userId, amount)
activate Redis
note over Redis: Chạy Lua Script nguyên tử:\n1. Check trạng thái ACTIVE\n2. Check cọc (FROZEN)\n3. Check amount > currentPrice + step\n4. Check userId != currentWinnerId\n5. Tự động gia hạn 60s nếu còn <= 30s
Redis --> Service: BidResult (Success, NewPrice, EndTime)
deactivate Redis

Service -> Broadcast: broadcastBidSuccess(sessionId, newPrice, endTime)
activate Broadcast
Broadcast -> Client: WebSocket STOMP [/topic/auctions/{id}] (NEW_BID event)
deactivate Broadcast

Service -[#blue]> DB: asyncPersistBid(bidRecord)
note right: Chạy bất đồng bộ để tránh\nblocking luồng WebSocket
activate DB
DB --> Service: Success
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller: BidResult (Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> Client: 200 OK (ApiResponse)
deactivate Controller

@enduml
